@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080

### Official async client: cluster info
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/java-client/cluster/info
Accept: application/json

### Official async client: cluster health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/java-client/cluster/health
Accept: application/json

### Spring Data reactive client: cluster info
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/spring-data/cluster/info
Accept: application/json

### Spring Data reactive client: cluster health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/spring-data/cluster/health
Accept: application/json

### Legacy alias ของ official client: info
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cluster/info
Accept: application/json

### Legacy alias ของ official client: health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cluster/health
Accept: application/json
